   {
    "type": "post",
    "description": "Hello all,  I am currently open to new opportunities!\n\nI have 3+ years of experience in web design, front-end development, and digital marketing, with more recent work in project management and client relations. My background spans both design and development, so I'm comfortable owning a project from start to finish.\n\nI'm primarily looking for full-time roles in web development or UX/UI design, though I'm open to contract and freelance work as well.\n\nIf you know of something that might be a good fit, or just want to connect, please reach out! \n\nThanks in advance!",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7471266336653066240?updateEntityUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afs_feedUpdate%3A%28V2%2Curn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7471266336653066240%29",
    "social_counts": {
